Version 4
SHEET 1 800 400
WIRE 0 0 80 0
WIRE 160 0 208 0
WIRE 208 0 240 0
WIRE 320 0 400 0
WIRE 208 0 208 64
FLAG 0 0 p1
IOPIN 0 0 BiDir
FLAG 400 0 p2
IOPIN 400 0 BiDir
FLAG 208 0 x
FLAG 208 144 0
TEXT -32 -112 Left 2 ;Inside the LoopProbe: the loop signal goes in at p1 and out at p2 (left to right). Outside .stb all three sources are 0: a wire.
TEXT -32 -80 Left 2 ;Vprb (0 V) is the ammeter: Iy = I(Vprb). Vinj is the series voltage injection, Iinj the shunt current injection into x. Vy = -V(x).
TEXT -32 208 Left 2 ;.stb run 1: Vinj = 1 (AC). Run 3: Iinj = 1. Then D = Vy1·Iy3 - Vy3·Iy1, T(Tian) = 1/(Vy1 + Iy3 - 2·D) - 1, T(GFT) = 1/(1/D - 1).
SYMBOL voltage 176 0 R90
WINDOW 0 -32 56 VBottom 2
WINDOW 3 32 56 VTop 2
SYMATTR InstName Vprb
SYMATTR Value 0
SYMBOL voltage 336 0 R90
WINDOW 0 -32 56 VBottom 2
WINDOW 3 32 56 VTop 2
SYMATTR InstName Vinj
SYMATTR Value 0 AC 0
SYMBOL current 208 144 R180
WINDOW 0 -32 56 Right 2
WINDOW 3 -32 24 Right 2
SYMATTR InstName Iinj
SYMATTR Value 0 AC 0
